    "engine": "knitr",
    "markdown": "# R objects {#robjectschap}\n![](/images/RObjects.png){style=\"width:200px; background: white; border-radius:5px; border: white 5px solid\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n\nIn the [foundations part](/foundations/intro.qmd) you learnt how to create a <u id='variable_tooltip'>__variable__</u>. \nThis consisted of assigning (`<-`) an __object__ a name. \nIn this chapter we will learn about __R objects__. \nThere are two major R terminologies to learn to fully understand __R objects__, <u id='class_tooltip'>__Class__</u> and <u id='data_structure_tooltip'>__Data structure__</u>.\n\n## Class\n![](/images/category.png){style=\"width:200px; background: white; border-radius:5px; border: white 5px solid\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n\nA R <u id='class_tooltip'>__Class__</u> refers to the type of data.\nThere are six basic <u id='class_tooltip'>__classes__</u> in R (Also known as the __atomic <u id='class_tooltip'>classes</u>__). \nThese materials cover:\n\n- [**Numerics**](/objects/numeric.qmd): Numbers\n  - Numeric can come in the form of <u id='integer_tooltip'>__integers__</u> and <u id='double_tooltip'>__doubles__</u>\n- [**Strings**](/objects/string.qmd): Text\n- [**Logicals**](/objects/logical.qmd): `TRUE` or `FALSE` \n\nThere are also the <u id='class_tooltip'>classes</u> __complex__ and __raw__.\n\n## Data structure\n![](/images/data_structure){style=\"width:150px; background: white; border-radius:5px\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n\n<u id='data_structure_tooltip'>__Data structures__</u> describe how data is structured in an __object__. \nWe will focus on 3 main types of <u id='data_structure_tooltip'>__data structures__</u>.\n\n- [**Scalar**](/objects/scalar.qmd): One value\n- [**Vectors** & **Lists**](/objects/vectors_lists.qmd): 1-dimensional structures containing multiple values\n- [**Data frames** & **Matrices**](/objects/data_frames_matrices.qmd): 2-dimensional structures containing multiple values over rows and columns (i.e. tabular)\n\n## Code sections\nIn this part, and for the rest of the course, you will use code sections in your R scripts to separate pages, sections, and parts in this book.\n\nFirst set your working directory to your course directory, create a script, and save it as __\"2-Objects.R\"__.\n\nNext create a code section at the top of this script called __\"Classes\"__.\n\nIn other words have the below at the top of your script:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Classes ####\n```\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-5bc2a712a672268690ec\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-5bc2a712a672268690ec\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"operator_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"+, -, /, *, etc.\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-eb4257984061d9a5f0a7\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-eb4257984061d9a5f0a7\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"variable_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Container of an R object with a name\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-2e51904dcc11293c8c1e\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-2e51904dcc11293c8c1e\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"function_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Named block of code that performs a specific task\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-40058be03856835a91f4\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-40058be03856835a91f4\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"class_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Object data type, e.g. integer, double, string, and logical\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-e2affed0fc07c3a0db31\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-e2affed0fc07c3a0db31\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"data_structure_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Object structure type, e.g. scalar, vector, and data frame\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-5f15dbf0612e2d0ae68d\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-5f15dbf0612e2d0ae68d\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"integer_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Number without decimal points\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-c2c63eafb087eb882bd1\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-c2c63eafb087eb882bd1\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"double_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Number with decimal points\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-ad70aeb204cf0338ed1d\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-ad70aeb204cf0338ed1d\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"string_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Text\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-ab95e6ed7362fa0feff7\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-ab95e6ed7362fa0feff7\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"logical_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"TRUE or FALSE\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-b3ef6b53b2d13192df93\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-b3ef6b53b2d13192df93\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"scalar_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"A single value in a object\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-0cbed5382d7281960e4d\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-0cbed5382d7281960e4d\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"vector_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Homogenous 1-dimensional data structure\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-f740ead031a5a41cd6e9\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-f740ead031a5a41cd6e9\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"matrix_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Homogeneous 2-dimensional data structure\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-01021408d98720a9041b\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-01021408d98720a9041b\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"data_frame_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Heterogeneous 2-dimensional data structure. Each column is homogeneous\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n",
